{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30587","headline":"和主司王起 · 裴翻","name":"和主司王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常将公道选羣生，犹被春闱屈重名。\n文柄久持殊岁纪，恩门三啓动寰瀛。\n云霄幸接鸳鸾盛，变化欣同草木荣。\n乍得阳和如细柳，参差长近亚夫营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴翻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}